  "limitations": [
    "This is an isolated Python/Win32 prototype exercising S1-B11 release conditions (1) and (2); it is not a product implementation and does not by itself make the product boundary verified.",
    "S1-B11 condition (3) 'target packaging/sandbox form' (MSIX/AppContainer re-run) and condition (4) (DACL/integrity level, S1-B3) are NOT_RUN here -- they need S1-B8 and S1-B3 respectively.",
    "Handle identity is (volume serial, file index); NTFS may reuse an index after deletion. The issue-time content digest is the defence-in-depth layer that also covers in-place equal-size rewrites by an adversary that already held a write handle (T-16/T-18).",
    "The pre-open reparse walk is an early rejection with its own race window; the authoritative containment decision is derived from the opened handle (GetFinalPathNameByHandle)."
